OL,3,GNEWSAThree people arrested in two
OL,4,Aseparate arson attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have been arrested
OL,7,Ffollowing two separate arson attacks in
OL,8,FCounty Tyrone.
OL,10,FPolice attended the scene of a fire at
OL,11,Fa property in Gortgonis Terrace,
OL,12,FCoalisland, at about 23:40 BST on
OL,13,FSunday.
OL,15,FThe fire was deliberately started in a
OL,16,Fbin which had been placed by a shed at
OL,17,Fthe property. Some damage was caused to
OL,18,Fthe shed door, along with smoke damage
OL,19,Finside the shed, however, there was no
OL,20,Ffurther damage reported.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
