OL,3,GNEWSAThree people arrested in two
OL,4,Aseparate arson attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn Cookstown, police received a report
OL,7,Fof a vacant property on fire in
OL,8,FCoolnafranky Park. The fire was
OL,9,Fcontained to the living room area, with
OL,10,Fsmoke damage caused to the adjoining
OL,11,Frooms. There was no one in either
OL,12,Fproperty at the time of the fires and
OL,13,Fno injuries were reported.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
